title: Fettuccine Alfredo
method: stovetop
source: https://www.newson6.com/recipes/il-vero-alfredo
protein: none
ingredient_count: 5
---

Melt @unsalted butter{4%oz} with the @water{2-3%oz}, @salt{1/2%tsp} and @?brandy{1/2%oz} in a #saute pan{}.

Add the @fettuccine{7%oz}(cooked) and bring to a light simmer.

Ensure that all the water does not completely evaporate. If it does, add a little extra.

Put the @parmigiano reggiano cheese{2%oz}(grated) in a separate #mixing bowl{}.

When the pasta is hot and steamy, add it into the cheese and toss to coat.

Serve immediately.